title: "VoxelSynth"
abstract: >-
  An offline integer lattice constructive solid geometry and signed distance
  field CAD workstation for 3D-printable enclosures, cable combs, and PCB
  fixtures, with watertight STL, OBJ, and OpenSCAD export.
type: software
license: MIT
